  "notes": [
    "The Replica runs through Nomad's UpgradeBeacon, which emits Upgrade(address) rather than EIP-1967 Upgraded; the last pre-exploit beacon upgrade selected implementation 0xb9233675, and the zero-root confirmation already held in proxy storage.",
    "Campaign and loss cover process() calls without an in-transaction proof after the anchor, on the anchor's Replica and its sibling Replicas; legitimate relays used proveAndProcess. Loss is loss.mjs over the BridgeRouter escrow. C3 has no DefiLlama price and is omitted; later recoveries are not deducted."
